message: "If you use or reference this research dossier, simulation models, or silicon microarchitecture specs, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "RIM Handset Re-Inception & Architectural Strategy: Modular Hardware, Companion Silicon, and Agentic Enterprise Model"
abstract: "A dual-chassis modular hardware platform (Platform A 6.4\" / Platform B 6.9\") paired with an inline 12nm R-SCE Companion ASIC for wire-speed compression (≥ 2.5 GB/s) and AES-256-GCM hardware encryption. Features a 100,000-run Monte Carlo launch model, < 35 DPMO SMT inspection protocol, US CHIPS Act Title IV grant proposal, and an Agentic AI enterprise restructuring strategy."
